      "created_at": "2012-11-09T22:00:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Ok, this is going to be the first time that I'm going to back up something on Kickstarter. I started clicking, but I'm kind of lost on how the whole thing works.</p><p>First, I want to kickstart the new expansion of course. But I also want to add some 'a la carte' items. The first page however, does not give a checkbox for any a la carte items. I haven't gone through all the hoops yet, but is there any point in the hoop chain where I can add some specific a la carte items?</p><p>Secondly, I want to pick it all up at Essen in 2013. When and how exactly will I be able to check this option in the kickstarter process? After a few clicks I still haven't seen this option anywhere?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
